+| `data/deep_chal_math_train_filtered.csv` | 훈련 필터링 파생본 | 16,528 | `id`, `question`, `answer` | `2844386e4d5c7355f773ac58f4b735be4e9ce1caa70b4b1a3576244e1346ff98` |
